      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "10k, NOT the 470 ohm supervisor.cir sized for the six driver gates. That figure came from Miller coupling at Crss = 500 pF on a node swinging to a 100 V boost rail. A relay drain is clamped by its own flyback diode at Vbat + Vf. Recheck if a relay FET with large Crss is chosen." (id 5) (at 101.84 281.92 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
